Relaciones de orden y equivalencia.ejemplo:
from collections import deque
adj = {"core": ["lib"], "lib": ["app"], "app": []}
indeg = {"core": 0, "lib": 1, "app": 1}
q, orden = deque(["core"]), []
while q:
    u = q.popleft()
    orden.append(u)
    for v in adj[u]:
        indeg[v] -= 1
        if indeg[v] == 0: q.append(v)
